    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math interesting, especially in chemistry where formulas help explain how things work. As a retired person who enjoys baking and painting, I see math as a tool—like measuring ingredients or understanding patterns in nature. It’s not my passion like art, but it’s useful and makes sense when connected to real life.",
